#describe what Removes four e2e tests that proved nothing about the app and gives every remaining Playwright spec a package.json script.
#describe before Twelve specs were run by no script.
#describe after Every test/e2e spec is named by a script, and the four new ones are listed in docs/primitives.md.
#describe verified typecheck, lint and pnpm test green; the newly wired scripts were each run once and several fail on their own, reported in the PR.
