#reason docs/primitives.md Agents find regression checks here, so the new scripts are listed with when to run them.
#reason package.json Specs no script ran stayed unrun and rotted, so each now has a named script.
#reason test/e2e/graph-navigation.spec.ts The removed test asserted harness window state and duplicated the zoom checks in graph-pixi.
#reason test/e2e/graph-regression.spec.ts The removed test checked Playwright's own screenshot comparison, not the app.
#reason test/e2e/tray-popover.spec.ts The removed logo tests compared SVG fill strings and saved screenshots nobody compared.
#reason test/e2e/graph-performance.md It documented the removed performance baseline, which no longer exists.
#reason test/e2e/graph-performance.spec.ts It had no latency budget and could not fail on a slowdown, so it gave false assurance.
#story Every browser check has a command
#step actor A developer
#step action runs a named check script
#file package.json
#file docs/primitives.md
#step subject the macro, review, selection or highlight specs
#below interaction Can run any e2e spec from a script found in the docs
#below consequence Twelve specs were run by nothing => Every spec belongs to a script
#story Tests that proved nothing are gone
#step actor A developer
#step action runs the graph and tray checks
#file test/e2e/graph-regression.spec.ts
#file test/e2e/graph-navigation.spec.ts
